  "extract": "The IMEL Building is a historic building in Tbilisi, the capital of Georgia, presently occupied by The Biltmore Hotel Tbilisi. The building was constructed in the 1930s and is located on Rustaveli Avenue, the city's main thoroughfare.",
  "extract_html": "<p>The <b>IMEL Building</b> is a historic building in Tbilisi, the capital of Georgia, presently occupied by <b>The Biltmore Hotel Tbilisi</b>. The building was constructed in the 1930s and is located on Rustaveli Avenue, the city's main thoroughfare.</p>"
